Prism Themes
============

This extension contains:

1. Ported UI palettes (61 semantic OKLCH keys per family, converted to sRGB hex)
   extracted from a locally installed copy of the T3 Code desktop application
   (server.asar). Themes: T3 Chat, Grove, Ocean, Ember, Iris — each in light
   and dark variants. These palettes belong to the T3 Code application;
   this port is intended for personal use.

2. Syntax token colors (tokenColors, 82 rules), the 16 terminal ANSI colors and
   a set of editor-internal colors taken from the "Material Theme Ocean" and
   "Material Theme Lighter" themes bundled inside the same application.
   Material Theme is © Mattia Astorino, licensed MIT
   (https://github.com/equinusocio/vscode-material-theme). The upstream archive
   did not include a separate LICENSE copy inside the application bundle;
   attribution is given here per the upstream MIT license.

